    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Underworld Of Dope Wars Mean Streets</strong></h2>Step into the dynamic underworld of Dope Wars Mean Streets and immerse yourself in an era that seamlessly blends exhilarating nostalgia with modern excitement. With its captivating 90s-inspired art style, every corner of the city pulses with vibrant life and untold thrills.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877590/extras/ff7c4956670b65601c4493c51ec76505.poster.avif?t=1713271132\" width=800 height=434 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877590/extras/ff7c4956670b65601c4493c51ec76505.webm?t=1713271132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877590/extras/ff7c4956670b65601c4493c51ec76505.mp4?t=1713271132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet the Hustlers</strong></h2>Each hustler character carries unique traits and an untold story. They navigate the streets, fiercely loyal to their gangs, striving to survive, battle, and make their mark.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877590/extras/d55911554b4bea28b087e31db5843761.avif?t=1713271132\" width=800 height=404 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Destroy. Stunt. Explore.</strong></h2>Embark on your adventure through a variety of game modes, each offering a distinct experience and the chance to delve deeper into the heart of the dangerous underworld. Whether you prefer to go it alone or team up with friends, there's a mode tailored to your style.<br>Currently available is Free Mode, allowing single players to roam the streets, wreaking havoc and earning satisfaction and experience points along the way.<br>Stay tuned for the upcoming release of Story Mode, Battle Royale, and Team Mode, each of which will unveil the secrets of Dope Wars Mean Streets in thrilling detail.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877590/extras/eaef90b66a437298620b954a010d707d.poster.avif?t=1713271132\" width=800 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877590/extras/eaef90b66a437298620b954a010d707d.webm?t=1713271132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877590/extras/eaef90b66a437298620b954a010d707d.mp4?t=1713271132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
